# Warehouse Product Catalog — Separate Page Implementation

## Background

Currently, the warehouse dashboard has a **single `/products` page** ([page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Shorno/WebstormProjects/bikalpo-project/apps/web/app/warehouse/%28management%29/dashboard/products/page.tsx)) that combines **both** the catalog browser and the user's inventory into one monolithic 805-line component. The new requirements call for a **dedicated Product Catalog page** at a new route (`/warehouse/dashboard/catalog`) that focuses purely on browsing and discovering products — separated from the inventory management view.

The new catalog page will:
1. Present the complete product hierarchy (Type → Category → Sub Category → Core Identity) in a **flat table layout** as shown in the requirements
2. Have cascading filter dropdowns (Type, Category, Sub Category, Core Identity)
3. Include a search bar in the header
4. Provide [View / Add] actions per core identity row
5. Include the "Request New Product Identity" modal
6. Show a "Can't find your product?" CTA section

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend — New Catalog Page

#### [NEW] [catalog/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Shorno/WebstormProjects/bikalpo-project/apps/web/app/warehouse/%28management%29/dashboard/catalog/page.tsx)

**New page at `/warehouse/dashboard/catalog`** — a dedicated product catalog browser.

Key UI sections (matching the requirements doc):

1. **Header Bar** — Logo area + search input (product name search with debounce)
2. **Filter Bar** — Four cascading dropdown filters:
   - Type (Grocery, Electronics, LPG, Fashion, Footwear)
   - Category (filtered by selected Type)
   - Sub Category (filtered by selected Category)
   - Core Identity (filtered by selected Sub Category)
3. **Product Table** — Flat table showing all core identities with columns:
   - `#` (row number)
   - Type
   - Category
   - Sub Category
   - Core Identity
   - Action ([View / Add] button)
4. **Core Identity Detail Panel** — When a user clicks [View], expand/show details:
   - Linked product variants (brand + variant combinations)
   - Prices, pack sizes, SKU codes
   - "Add to Inventory" inline action for each variant
5. **"Can't Find Your Product?" Section** — CTA card with "Request New Product Identity" button
6. **Request Modal** — Reusable modal for submitting new product identity requests (extracted from existing code or copied)

**Data Sources:**
- Reuses the existing `orpc.warehouse.getCatalogHierarchy` API endpoint (already has filtering + search + inventory status)
- Reuses the existing `orpc.warehouse.addToInventory` endpoint
- Reuses the existing `orpc.warehouse.submitProductRequest` / `getMyProductRequests` endpoints

> [!IMPORTANT]
> No backend API changes are required. All the needed endpoints already exist in the [warehouse router](file:///c:/Users/Shorno/WebstormProjects/bikalpo-project/packages/api/src/routers/warehouse.ts#L1526-L1787). The existing `getCatalogHierarchy` endpoint returns the full Type→Category→SubCategory→CoreProduct hierarchy with inventory status already tagged.

